1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,415
W: Did you cancel your trip?

2
00:00:01,975 --> 00:00:03,835
I thought you were supposed to take off today.

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:09,295
M: I was, but I got a great deal on a plane ticket from a friend of mine who works at a travel agency.

4
00:00:09,975 --> 00:00:12,535
So I decided to fly to New York next Monday instead.

5
00:00:13,170 --> 00:00:13,375
W: Wow!

6
00:00:13,855 --> 00:00:14,455
That is great.

7
00:00:15,290 --> 00:00:16,515
What about your hotel reservation?

8
00:00:17,575 --> 00:00:18,750
Were you able to change it?

9
00:00:19,255 --> 00:00:23,425
I heard it's very hard to get any rooms this week because of the film festival there.

10
00:00:23,955 --> 00:00:25,560
M: Actually, I ended up canceling it.

11
00:00:25,995 --> 00:00:31,965
It turns out that another friend of mine has a condominium there, and he said I could use it while I am staying there.

12
00:00:32,555 --> 00:00:38,415
He recently moved out here from New York because of his new job, and he hasn't had enough time to get rid of it yet.
